nts", "patents", "clinical-trials", "jupyter-notebooks"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "dimeq", "name": "Dimeq", "description": "Dimeq is a Norwegian maritime safety technology company working to prevent loss of life at sea and set new health, safety and environmental (HSE) standards for the maritime sector. Its Eye-D System is an IoT-based digital ecosystem that delivers real-time positioning of crew and passengers to one-meter accuracy during emergencies, man-overboard\u2026", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "maritime", "safety", "iot", "man-overboard-detection", "emergency-response", "hse", "real-time-positioning", "norway"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "dinari", "name": "Dinari", "description": "Dinari provides tokenized US stocks and ETFs (dShares) backed 1:1 by real securities, giving businesses an API to offer global customers regulated access to over a hundred equities and index tokens across 85+ jurisdictions.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "tokenized-securities", "stocks", "etfs", "brokerage", "market-data", "blockchain", "stablecoin", "fintech", "kyc", "orders", "wallets"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "dingdong", "name": "Dingdong", "description": "Dingdong (Dingdong Maicai / \u53ee\u549a\u4e70\u83dc) is a Shanghai-based on-demand fresh-grocery e-commerce company operating a front-warehouse (dark-store) model that delivers fruit, vegetables, meat, seafood and prepared foods to consumers, typically within about 30 minutes, through its mobile app.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "technology", "e-commerce", "grocery", "food-delivery", "on-demand", "retail", "china"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "dingdong-maicai", "name": "Dingdong Maicai", "description": "Dingdong Maicai (\u53ee\u549a\u4e70\u83dc), operated by Shanghai Yibai Mi Network Technology Co., Ltd., is a Chinese on-demand fresh grocery e-commerce and delivery platform. It runs a mobile-app marketplace for fresh produce, meat, seafood, prepared foods, and daily groceries, backed by a network of front-line neighborhood micro-fulfillment stations that enable\u2026", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "consumer", "grocery", "e-commerce", "food-delivery", "retail", "fresh-produce", "china"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "dinii", "name": "Dinii", "description": "Dinii (\u682a\u5f0f\u4f1a\u793e\u30c0\u30a4\u30cb\u30fc) is a Tokyo-based restaurant-technology SaaS company, founded in June 2018, offering an \"All in One Restaurant Cloud\" for food-service businesses. Its integrated modules span POS register, customer mobile ordering, mobile self-checkout payment, customer management/CRM (with LINE integration), staff attendance and scheduling\u2026", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "consumer", "restaurants", "point-of-sale", "mobile-ordering", "food-service", "saas", "crm", "japan"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "dinmo", "name": "DinMo", "description": "DinMo is a composable Customer Data Platform (CDP) that turns a cloud data warehouse into a marketing activation engine. It connects directly to Snowflake, Google BigQuery, Databricks, Amazon Redshift, PostgreSQL, Microsoft Fabric, and ClickHouse, lets non-technical teams model customer data and build no-code segments, and activates those\u2026", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "customer-data-platform", "cdp", "reverse-etl", "data-activation", "data-warehouse", "audience-segmentation", "marketing", "personalization", "martech"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "dino-markets", "name": "dino.markets", "description": "dino.markets \u2014 Real-time cross-venue sports prediction-market data. Matches the same game across Kalshi and Polymarket, computes live cross-venue arbitr