 "ubank is an Australian digital-only bank offering savings accounts and home loans online and over the phone. Launched in 2008 as the online banking brand of National Australia Bank (NAB), ubank operates under NAB's authorised deposit-taking institution (ADI) licence and is registered in the Consumer Data Right (CDR) ecosystem as the \"UBank\" data\u2026", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "financial", "banks", "banking", "open-banking", "cdr", "consumer-data-right", "product-reference-data", "digital-bank", "consumer-banking", "australia"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubble", "name": "Ubble", "description": "Ubble is a Paris-founded identity verification company, now part of Checkout.com and operated as the Checkout.com Identity Verification (Identities) solution. Its API at api.ubble.ai powers video-based identity verification, ID document verification, AML screening with ongoing monitoring, biometric face authentication, and address/bank/company\u2026", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "identity-verification", "kyc", "aml", "biometrics", "face-authentication", "document-verification", "fraud-prevention", "compliance", "fintech"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubc", "name": "University of British Columbia", "description": "The University of British Columbia (UBC) is a public research university in Vancouver and Kelowna, British Columbia, Canada, ranked #33 in the QS World University Rankings 2025. UBC's public developer footprint is led by UBC Library, which operates the Open Collections API (an ElasticSearch-backed REST API over digitized collections) and the\u2026", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "education", "higher-education", "university", "canada", "library", "open-data", "research-data", "digital-collections"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubeam", "name": "uBEAM", "description": "uBeam was an ultrasonic wireless power startup founded in 2011 by Meredith Perry and headquartered in Marina del Rey, California. It raised roughly $26 million from Andreessen Horowitz, Upfront Ventures, Founders Fund, Mark Cuban, and Marissa Mayer to charge devices over the air using 45-75 kHz phased-array ultrasound.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "wireless-charging", "ultrasound", "hardware", "consumer-electronics", "defunct"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "uber", "name": "Uber", "description": "Uber is a global technology platform offering transportation, food delivery, and logistics services. Its developer platform provides APIs for integrating ride requests, food ordering, on-demand delivery, voucher programs, and business travel management into third-party applications.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "ride-sharing", "rides", "taxis", "transportation", "food-delivery", "delivery", "logistics"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "uber-direct", "name": "Uber Direct", "description": "Uber Direct is Uber's last-mile delivery-as-a-service platform that lets merchants dispatch couriers via the Uber network for on-demand and scheduled deliveries.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "logistics", "last-mile-delivery", "couriers", "fulfillment", "daas"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "uber-eats", "name": "Uber Eats", "description": "Uber Eats exposes a family of developer APIs through the Uber Developer Portal that let restaurants, marketplace platforms, POS providers, and logistics partners integrate directly with Uber Eats and Uber Direct.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "uber-eats", "uber-direct", "food-delivery", "last-mile-logistics", "restaurants", "menus", "orders", "fulfillment", "courier", "oauth2"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "uber-freight", "name": "Uber Freight", "description": "Uber Freight is a digital freight brokerage platform providing 24/7 access to truckload freight with instant quoting and booking, real-time shipment visibility, lane management, and carrier network pricing.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "freight", "logistics", "trucking", "shipping", "transportation", "supply-chain", "truckload", "carrier-network", "tms", "digital-freight-broker"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "uberduck", "name": "Uberduck", "description": "Uberduck is an AI voice platform whose public REST API converts text into natural-sounding speech across a catalog of voices and provider-backed models (AWS Polly, Google Cloud, Azure), lists and filters those voices, creates instant zero-shot voice clones from reference audio, and mints LiveKit tokens for real-time conversational AI voice calls.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "ai", "text-to-speech", "tts", "voice", "voice-cloning", "speech-synthesis", "conversational-ai"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubersense", "name": "UberSense", "description": "UberSense was a Boston, Massachusetts sports-technology startup whose mobile app provided slow-motion video capture and analysis for coaching athletes, from recreational to Olympic and professional levels.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "consumer", "sports", "video", "coaching", "mobile", "acquired"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubervu", "name": "uberVU", "description": "uberVU was a social media analytics and monitoring company, backed by Seedcamp, that offered brand-insight dashboards and a metrics API before being acquired by Hootsuite in 2014. The company no longer operates independently - ubervu.com now 301-redirects to blog.hootsuite.com/social-media-analytics/, its former metrics API is retired, and its\u2026", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "social-media", "analytics", "monitoring", "acquired", "defunct"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubeya", "name": "Ubeya", "description": "Ubeya is an AI-powered workforce management platform for businesses that rely on hourly and temporary workers, including staffing agencies, stadiums, events, hospitality, catering, healthcare, and retail operations.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "workforce-management", "staffing", "scheduling", "time-and-attendance", "payroll", "events", "hospitality", "human-resources"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubidots", "name": "Ubidots", "description": "Ubidots is an Industrial AIoT platform designed for OEMs, system integrators, and engineering firms that need to ingest, visualize, and act on device telemetry at scale. The platform exposes a REST API (v1.6 and v2) and an MQTT API for sending and retrieving time-series data from IoT sensors and devices.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "iot", "internet-of-things", "telemetry", "time-series", "mqtt", "rest", "dashboards", "device-management", "analytics", "industrial-iot", "aiot"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubio-automation-cloud", "name": "UBIO Automation Cloud", "description": "UBIO (ubio.ai, formerly ub.io) is a London-based, Techstars-backed web automation company. Its Automation Cloud platform runs automation scripts as jobs through a REST API, automating end-to-end website flows such as flight and hotel booking, broadband signup, insurance quotes, and job applications.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "automation", "web-automation", "rpa", "travel", "booking", "jobs", "company"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubiome", "name": "uBiome", "description": "uBiome is a company surfaced as a portfolio company of a16z and added to the API Evangelist network as a stub for enrichment. This profile is a lead awaiting the enrichment pipeline.", "desc_sourc