d, and Index Ventures. It built Display.land, a multiplayer 3D/AR/VR capture and creation platform, acquired Wavy AR, and was acquired by Discord in June 2021, after which its products were discontinued.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "entertainment", "augmented-reality", "3d-mapping", "computer-vision", "gaming", "acquired"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubitricity", "name": "Ubitricity", "description": "Ubitricity is a Berlin-based electric vehicle charging company and wholly-owned subsidiary of Shell, best known for integrating EV charge points into existing street infrastructure such as lampposts and bollards.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "energy", "ev-charging", "electric-vehicles", "charging-infrastructure", "lamppost-charging", "smart-charging", "mobility", "ocpp"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubix", "name": "UBIX Labs", "description": "UBIX Labs is a no-code, cloud-based AI platform designed to democratize artificial intelligence for business users. The platform provides end-to-end AI capabilities including data integration, model development, deployment, and conversational AI through modular components.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "artificial-intelligence", "analytics", "machine-learning", "data-integration", "no-code", "enterprise", "generative-ai"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubooly", "name": "Ubooly", "description": "Ubooly was a children's smart-toy company that made \"The Learning Toy that Listens\" - a plush toy that turned a smartphone, iPod touch, or tablet into an interactive learning companion for kids aged 4-8, with hand-crafted play packs and voice interaction.", "desc_source": "apis.yml:description", "topics": ["apis-json", "company", "toys", "education", "children", "consumer", "defunct"], "topics_source": "apis.yml:tags"}, {"slug": "ubq-materials", "name": "UBQ Mate